    "detailed_description": "Join the Spooky Crew and uncover the secret of the Mask of the Mysterium in this point and click adventure game. An encounter with a masked figure leads the crew to investigate the secrets of a local museum.<br>Classic adventure gameplay that isn\u2019t stuck in the nostalgic past. Modern twists like different ways to approach puzzles and multiple endings update the formula and keep the game moving along without the player getting stuck and bored. <br>The Mask of the Mysterium is the pilot episode of a planned ongoing series of shorter games with a focus on tight pacing while still retaining a sense of freedom and rewarding the player for experimentation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet The Crew</h2><br><strong>Alyssa</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463610/extras/2127132b94f0a405ef3d5f8b35cf86f1.avif?t=1707776309\" /></span><br>The tattoo of a magnifying glass on her arm is dedicated to her lifelong commitment to unravelling mysteries. Alyssa cracks cases with a, mostly, thoughtful and considered approach.<br><br><strong>Ethyl</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463610/extras/722653976093ab5a2c0a5ed4501c5c7d.avif?t=1707776309\" /></span><br>A robot built for mystery solving. Ethyl\u2019s analytical skills prove to be essential in almost every case the Spooky Crew take on.<br><br><strong>Hector</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463610/extras/60e70b570d9ba558539c067cf403d3b8.avif?t=1707776309\" /></span><br>Hector\u2019s passion for mysteries is matched only by his recklessness. There is nothing he won\u2019t do to get to the bottom of things.<br><br><strong>Bert</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463610/extras/a9121d99aaf4b0b756203f94754591a0.avif?t=1707776309\" /></span><br>A kangaroo in a man suit? A man in a kangaroo suit? Who knows really. All we know is that he\u2019s dedicated to solving mysteries. Probably. Only his life companion, Hector, seems able to understand him.",
